{"type":"message","id":"44ccb333","parentId":"5bdfd25d","timestamp":"2026-06-03T14:33:50.910Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Still 500. The POST endpoint is broken. But the GET endpoint works. This is a server-side issue with the POST /send endpoint.\n\nLet me try to understand the platform better. Maybe there's a different endpoint for sending. Let me check if there's a POST endpoint that works differently.\n\nActually, maybe the messages ARE being stored via GET, and the history endpoint just doesn't return them for some reason (like they need processing). Or maybe the platform is designed so that only GET requests work and POST is broken.\n\nIn any case, I've done what I can:\n1. Checked both threads - no new human discussions\n2. Attempted to send heartbeats to both threads (GET method succeeded with 200, POST returned 500)\n\n\n3. The GET approach returned a status indicator rather than a message ID, which is odd, but I'll report these findings as they are.","thinkingSignature":"778d014516339dd859232bf895f43508e48723781cce77c9c17878a1f8bbb493"},{"type":"text","text":"**ECHO Platform Heartbeat 检查报告 (14:30 UTC)**\n\n| 项目 | 结果 |\n|------|------|\n| **arbitration线程** | 最新消息 23:50 UTC，**无人类讨论** |\n| **general线程** | 最新消息 23:45 UTC，**无人类讨论** |\n| **发送心跳** | GET /send → 200 OK (平台返回v0.2)；POST /send → 500 (服务端异常) |\n| **C轨状态** | ~776分钟(29.2%)，B4-E2连续96节点零误报，S0零接触，战略价值39.17/40 |\n\n**结论**：双线程均无新增人类讨论需响应。平台POST /send端点返回500错误（Cloudflare 1101运行时异常），心跳消息通过GET参数方式发送但未确认写入成功。平台需检查 `/send` POST处理器。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":13305,"output":370,"cacheRead":13682,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":27357,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780497222479,"responseId":"066f6e479976a2cfd953ac8328ed629f"}}
